Package: libmarinholab-solver-osqp
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: C++ OSQP ADMM solver wrapper (marinholab)
 The marinholab-solvers-osqp C++ package provides the ROS-independent
 C++ part of the solver-osqp project: the marinholab::solvers::osqp
 namespace with the Solver (a first-order ADMM quadratic-program solver
 wrapping OSQP's OSQPSolver) and its Configuration option holder.
 .
 It is built with CMake (with -O3) and exposes the CMake target
 marinholab::solvers::osqp. The OSQP dependency (osqp/osqp) is vendored as a
 git submodule, built as a static archive (its linear-solver, qdldl, is
 embedded), and bundled into the same package. The pybind11 Python extension
 is intentionally NOT part of this package; it is produced by `pip install .`
 from the same source tree.
